    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, really? you're saying restorative justice is bad because it focuses on victims? most people i talk to say the exact opposite—that retributive justice is just about vengeance and doesn't actually help anyone. why do you think the retributive side is more \"fair\" than one that tries to heal the community?",
